<title>USA: Albank says stockholders reject sale proposal.</title>
<headline>Albank says stockholders reject sale proposal.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, N.Y. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albank Financial Corp said Wednesday that its shareholders rejected a proposal that the bank holding company be sold or merged with another company.</p>
<p>Albank Chairman Herbert Chorbaijian said that the vote by 83 percent of the company's shareholders was a &quot;clear endorsement of our longer-term plans.&quot;</p>
